{"src":"en","tgt":"hi","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"hi","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7945.581976999999,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":10071.406195000001,"text":"हालाँकि, इस मामले में शेनज़ेन क्षेत्र कुछ हद तक एक देश की तरह ही कार्य करता है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":10166.667439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10171.223632000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10176.497504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10181.564539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10186.27971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":10186.931449000002,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15101.550626000002,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":17597.033809,"text":"मक्का के उत्तर में स्थित पहाड़ों में से एक की चोटी पर स्थित यह गुफा बहुत ही निकट स्थित है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":17686.682827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":17691.591914999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17696.707649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17701.746504,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17707.151633999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17707.569097,"samples":14360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":17940.574802,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":19070.818893,"text":"दुनिया के बाकी हिस्सों से अलग-थलग।"},{"kind":"audio","t":19151.075967999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19156.559235999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19159.557795999997,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":26274.897034999998,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":29245.415328,"text":"अब लोग कंप्यूटर की स्क्रीन पर ही संदेश लिखते हैं, उन्हें कभी भी शार्पनर के पास जाने की आवश्यकता नहीं होती।"},{"kind":"audio","t":29349.751109999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29355.161968999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":29360.049187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":29365.148852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29370.428613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29375.631456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29377.030112999997,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":37523.378765,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":41361.137356,"text":"उन देशों की ओर जाने वाले यात्रियों, जहाँ करों की दरें बहुत अधिक हैं, कभी-कभी काफी धन बचा सकते हैं, खासकर शराब एवं तंबाकू जैसी वस्तुओं पर।"},{"kind":"audio","t":41467.736170000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":41473.013712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41478.100166000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41483.419207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41488.64994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41493.799663000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41499.024086000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":41503.219656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41503.614549000005,"samples":15656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":45772.715662,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":47885.180104,"text":"पौधे प्रकाश-संश्लेषण के माध्यम से सूर्य से अपना भोजन बनाते हैं। वे पर्याप्त छाया भी प्रदान करते हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":47980.062164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47985.218028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47990.289553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":47995.488645000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48000.609710000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48005.888071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48006.251355,"samples":13992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":58052.385293,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":62102.970028,"text":"अस्पताल ने संक्रमण नियंत्रण हेतु प्रोटोकॉल का पालन किया है; इसमें दूसरों के संक्रमण से बचने हेतु मरीज़ को अन्य लोगों से अलग रखना भी शामिल है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":62185.83295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62190.867285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62196.141937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62199.924274000005,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":62281.901990000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62287.28749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62292.559511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":62297.640566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62303.137324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62303.554697,"samples":15560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":68162.493898,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":71557.798474,"text":"किया गया कार्य ज्यादातर सैद्धांतिक था, लेकिन इस प्रोग्राम को संश्लेषण तारामंडल के अवलोकनों का अनुकरण करने हेतु लिखा गया था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":71666.79392699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71672.02634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71676.82044899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71682.089301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71687.368492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71692.26129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":71697.43686399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71699.60951699999,"samples":27424,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":78289.331484,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":82158.90828199999,"text":"बार्सिलोना की आधिकारिक भाषाएँ कैटलन एवं स्पेनिश हैं। लगभग आधे लोग कैटलन भाषा में बात करना पसंद करते हैं, बहुसंख्यक लोग इसे समझते हैं, और लगभग हर कोई स्पेनिश जानता है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":82312.461769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82317.56661299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82322.780506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":82327.90397999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":82332.98292499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82338.09112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82342.581924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82345.716432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82348.953228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82352.331561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82354.20934,"samples":32320,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":83784.786817,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":86985.16862899999,"text":"कुछ क्षेत्रों में पानी को एक मिनट तक उबालना ही पर्याप्त होता है, जबकि अन्य जगहों पर कई मिनटों की आवश्यकता होती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":87084.141181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87089.130137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87094.29797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":87099.400725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87104.521809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":87109.66028299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87112.859679,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":89845.365561,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":92770.351507,"text":"पौधे प्राकृतिक वातावरण में ही सबसे अच्छे दिखते हैं, इसलिए एक भी डंठल हटाने के लालच का विरोध करें।"},{"kind":"audio","t":92865.414305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":92870.53665899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":92875.652063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":92880.70178799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92886.030369,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92891.279371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92891.77384299999,"samples":16992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":97259.22297799999,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":100053.709041,"text":"1920 के दशक में, अधिकांश नागरिकों एवं राष्ट्रों का प्रचलित दृष्टिकोण शांतिवाद एवं एकांतवाद का था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":100150.655067,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100155.603674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100160.59403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100165.720084,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":100170.966546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100175.91961299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":100180.432978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":100180.653914,"samples":5824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103516.274259,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":106682.991455,"text":"मासा सेरिफ अपने समय का सर्वश्रेष्ठ शिकारी था, इसलिए उसे मोसुल के अन्य जानवरों के अलावा किसी चीज़ से डर नहीं था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":106785.744993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106790.996435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106796.189438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":106801.294213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106806.549655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":106811.55750099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":106816.35587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":106816.624706,"samples":7624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113121.068793,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":116505.35273299999,"text":"1537 में असुंसियन की स्थापना के बाद से, पराग्वे ने अपनी कई स्वदेशी विशेषताओं एवं पहचानों को बनाए रखने में सफलता हासिल की है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":116620.80180799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116626.05794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116631.367411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116637.01032599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116641.60123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116646.575476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116651.776329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116655.775312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116658.248341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":116658.51247599999,"samples":3288,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119857.405233,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":122531.10329,"text":"यह बीमारी सूअरों द्वारा फैलती है, जो बाद में मच्छरों के माध्यम से मनुष्यों तक पहुँचती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":122631.511717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122636.790129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122641.845894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122647.111706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":122652.22342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122653.19692399999,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":129344.176704,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":133112.560968,"text":"अधिकांश आधुनिक अनुसंधान दूरबीनें, अनुकूल वायुमंडलीय परिस्थितियों वाले दूरदराज के क्षेत्रों में स्थित विशाल सुविधाएँ हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":133219.779481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133225.075782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133230.00804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133235.412179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":133240.534873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133245.800815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133250.87316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133251.219534,"samples":14224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":135213.32313499998,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":137581.670389,"text":"लोग यह उम्मीद नहीं कर सकते कि यात्रियों के लिए धैर्य एवं समझ भी आवश्यक होती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":137669.394439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137674.71472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137679.686807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137685.013728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137690.147252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137690.498346,"samples":13160,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":140530.096093,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":142633.45865699998,"text":"इसलिए यह संभव है कि यह संकेतन केवल एक लेबल के रूप में ही जोड़ा गया हो।"},{"kind":"audio","t":142729.002106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142731.809699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142733.245505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142734.620062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142735.62612499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":142735.876711,"samples":1760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147758.906191,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":149862.58367999998,"text":"लेकिन पक्षियों से जुड़ी कई चीजें अभी भी डायनासोर जैसी ही दिखती हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":149955.314786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149960.41111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149965.602143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149970.960154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149971.80244899998,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":154945.2352,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":157873.491032,"text":"वे लगभग सभी रेतीले समुद्र तट हैं, जहाँ तैरना सुरक्षित है, एवं अधिकांश में पर्याप्त छाया उपलब्ध है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":157970.619204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157976.041863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157981.07936899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157986.288872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157991.352847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157996.605879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157996.97530299998,"samples":14592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":158186.252721,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158658.043415,"text":"पोहिकन पेड़।"},{"kind":"audio","t":158741.931359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158742.297303,"samples":11632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":164334.952948,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":168024.324705,"text":"डुवाल, जो विवाहित हैं एवं उनके दो वयस्क बच्चे हैं, ने मिलर पर कोई खास प्रभाव नहीं डाला; क्योंकि यह कहानी मिलर को ही सुनाई गई थी।"},{"kind":"audio","t":168126.86633699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168132.146669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168137.329402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168142.143861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168147.612989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168148.14568,"samples":16760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"audio","t":168218.261165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168223.3577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168227.069788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":168227.346203,"samples":96,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":178304.080609,"code":1005}]}